<title>USA: Flagstar &quot;concerned&quot; with slow 1997 start.</title>
<headline>Flagstar &quot;concerned&quot; with slow 1997 start.</headline>
<dateline>SPARTANBURG, S.C. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flagstar Cos Inc said on Thursday that it was &quot;somewhat concerned&quot; about a slow 1997 start, and has hired Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp to help plan improvements in its capital structure.</p>
<p>The company said customer counts at its Denny's restaurants have fallen short of expectations since a pricing increase, and its Hardee's restaurants face obstacles to increasing traffic.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
